DESCRIPTION >
    Wave 3 aggregated attribution. One row per (source, medium, campaign) with
    conversions=count() and revenue=SUM(toFloat64OrZero(toString(conversion_value))),
    serving lastTouchAttribution (api/lib/attribution-engine.js:92-152, queryName
    'last_touch_attribution'). Faithful 1:1 port.
    NOT the same as last_touch_by_site.pipe — that is a per-conversion ROW-PULL (no aggregation,
    no revenue). This pipe REUSES that pipe's VALIDATED inner ASOF structure (per-field argMax
    null-skip) and adds (a) conversion_value to the conv subquery and (b) the outer
    GROUP BY source,medium,campaign + count + SUM(revenue) matching the live HogQL outer.
    ARGMAX NULL-SKIP (money-critical, reproduced EXACTLY): the live query computes
    argMax(col, timestamp) SEPARATELY per field (utm_source/medium/campaign/ai_source), and
    ClickHouse argMax SKIPS rows where the aggregated col is NULL — so different fields can come
    from different touchpoints. Reproduced as 4 INDEPENDENT ASOF LEFT JOINs, each with
    `<field> IS NOT NULL` in its pageview subquery so ASOF (timestamp <= conv.timestamp = last
    preceding) picks the last NON-NULL value per field. This is the exact structure validated in
    last_touch_by_site.pipe against real fired data (Phase 4c fixture visitor Y); a single
    whole-row ASOF was proven WRONG there. Join key distinct_id (matches live :127, not visitor_id).
    Typed-column translation (§2.6): properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type; pageview
    fields read from events_by_visitor (visitor-ordered projection, required for ASOF).
    MONEY: revenue cast toFloat64OrZero(toString(conversion_value)) == live
    toFloatOrZero(toString(e.properties.conversion_value)); conv subquery is 1 row per $conversion
    (event_id unique), each ASOF LEFT JOIN adds <=1 match, so each conversion contributes its
    value exactly once — matches the live 1:1 e.uuid = lt.conversion_uuid join + SUM.
    SCOPE LIMIT (inherited from last_touch_by_site.pipe): validated only for
    distinct_id == visitor_id; merged-identity case UNVERIFIED.
    VALUE-PARITY NOT RUN (rate-limited) — founder must value-gate before enabling. NOT DEPLOYED.

NODE last_touch_by_site_agg_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        COALESCE(NULLIF(utm_source, ''), NULLIF(ai_source, ''), 'direct') AS source,
        COALESCE(NULLIF(utm_medium, ''), 'none') AS medium,
        COALESCE(utm_campaign, '') AS campaign,
        count() AS conversions,
        SUM(toFloat64OrZero(toString(conversion_value))) AS revenue
    FROM
    (
        SELECT
            conv.conversion_value AS conversion_value,
            src.utm_source AS utm_source,
            med.utm_medium AS utm_medium,
            camp.utm_campaign AS utm_campaign,
            ai.ai_source AS ai_source
        FROM
        (
            SELECT event_id, distinct_id, timestamp, conversion_value
            FROM events
            WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
              AND event_type = '$conversion'
              AND timestamp >= {{ DateTime(date_from, required=True) }}
              AND timestamp < {{ DateTime(date_to, required=True) }}
        ) AS conv
        ASOF LEFT JOIN
        (
            SELECT distinct_id, timestamp, utm_source FROM events_by_visitor
            WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
              AND event_type = '$pageview' AND utm_source IS NOT NULL
        ) AS src ON conv.distinct_id = src.distinct_id AND src.timestamp <= conv.timestamp
        ASOF LEFT JOIN
        (
            SELECT distinct_id, timestamp, utm_medium FROM events_by_visitor
            WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
              AND event_type = '$pageview' AND utm_medium IS NOT NULL
        ) AS med ON conv.distinct_id = med.distinct_id AND med.timestamp <= conv.timestamp
        ASOF LEFT JOIN
        (
            SELECT distinct_id, timestamp, utm_campaign FROM events_by_visitor
            WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
              AND event_type = '$pageview' AND utm_campaign IS NOT NULL
        ) AS camp ON conv.distinct_id = camp.distinct_id AND camp.timestamp <= conv.timestamp
        ASOF LEFT JOIN
        (
            SELECT distinct_id, timestamp, ai_source FROM events_by_visitor
            WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
              AND event_type = '$pageview' AND ai_source IS NOT NULL
        ) AS ai ON conv.distinct_id = ai.distinct_id AND ai.timestamp <= conv.timestamp
    )
    GROUP BY source, medium, campaign
    ORDER BY revenue DESC
    LIMIT 50000

TYPE endpoint
